(4797913, 693926, 61961, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge, I guess!  Anyway, pretty subject, I like the waving wheat, and nice juxtaposition of the old and new subjects.<br/> <br/>Several problems: seems to lack sharpness - might be a resizing issue.  Horizon line is centered, conventional wisdom says it is more visually interesting if the horizon is on one of the "thirds."  Also, exposure is a bit blown out in the clouds.</td>', 'Wrong challenge, I guess!  Anyway, pretty subject, I like the waving wheat, and nice juxtaposition of the old and new subjects. Several problems: seems to lack sharpness - might be a resizing issue.  Horizon line is centered, conventional wisdom says it is more visually interesting if the horizon is on one of the "thirds."  Also, exposure is a bit blown out in the clouds.', '2008-07-02 11:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4798012, 694422, 94306, '<td valign="top">very nice composition. probably the most interesting of the bunch!</td>', 'very nice composition. probably the most interesting of the bunch!', '2008-07-02 11:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
