(4806096, 693760, 82985, '<td valign="top">NICE!  It might be worth playing with the crop on this one:  I think a crop in from the right to take out the  building just on the edge of the frame would also take out the little dark element in the water over there.  And then a crop down from the top just to take out the remainder of the bright cloud elements in the upper right corner would help.  The lower corners are perfect, and taking the highlights out of the upper right will help to keep the viewer "in" the image.  Of course, my idea could ruin it completely, too....  7</td>', 'NICE!  It might be worth playing with the crop on this one:  I think a crop in from the right to take out the  building just on the edge of the frame would also take out the little dark element in the water over there.  And then a crop down from the top just to take out the remainder of the bright cloud elements in the upper right corner would help.  The lower corners are perfect, and taking the highlights out of the upper right will help to keep the viewer "in" the image.  Of course, my idea could ruin it completely, too....  7', '2008-07-06 00:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
