(4813507, 694025, 74829, '<td valign="top">Wow... My first Ribbon, so happy.<br/> <br/>specially thanks to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=8759" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tiberius</a>, He is my MASTER. i learn a lots from him.<br/> <br/>and also thanks my homeland "Hong Kong". it give me so much opportunity to take nice photos.<br/> <br/>finally thanks to everyone who Voted me..<br/> <br/>Many thanks and God Bless everyone!~<br/></td>', 'Wow... My first Ribbon, so happy. specially thanks to  tiberius, He is my MASTER. i learn a lots from him. and also thanks my homeland "Hong Kong". it give me so much opportunity to take nice photos. finally thanks to everyone who Voted me.. Many thanks and God Bless everyone!~', '2008-07-09 01:46:58.000000', NULL, 0),
