(4813516, 692085, 27735, '<td valign="top">Actually, we were sitting at field level, right behind home plate on the third base side.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jammur:</b></div><hr/><i> Cheap seats, good picture.<br/>Like the the framing of the actual cityscape with the structure of the ballpark </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Actually, we were sitting at field level, right behind home plate on the third base side. Originally posted by Jammur: Cheap seats, good picture.Like the the framing of the actual cityscape with the structure of the ballpark ', '2008-07-09 01:49:01.000000', NULL, 0),
