(4813698, 694399, 39427, '<td valign="top">The Starbursts of the lights and lights of the cars are very nice.  All the technical aspects are nice, however, I dont'' feel like the backdrop is anything out of the ordinary, just looks like a regular suburb with signs and sidewalks and all that.  So, I hope you take this with a grain of salt, but I feel like this pic overall is nothign people haven''t seen before and so it might have been reflected in your score.</td>', 'The Starbursts of the lights and lights of the cars are very nice.  All the technical aspects are nice, however, I dont'' feel like the backdrop is anything out of the ordinary, just looks like a regular suburb with signs and sidewalks and all that.  So, I hope you take this with a grain of salt, but I feel like this pic overall is nothign people haven''t seen before and so it might have been reflected in your score.', '2008-07-09 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
