(4813963, 694343, 27812, '<td valign="top">Tibby! You are an animal, how could you do it to all of us?! Well done my friend and I hope you and the family are okay. Love you my brother.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-09 07:04:32.</i></td>', 'Tibby! You are an animal, how could you do it to all of us?! Well done my friend and I hope you and the family are okay. Love you my brother.', '2008-07-09 08:03:31.000000', '2008-07-09 08:04:32.000000', 0),
(4813969, 694097, 76335, '<td valign="top">Because you have no comments... I gave this a six. It''s not a true landscape, but neither were a lot of shots in this challenge. It''s urban enough though. I like dramatic angles, and I''ve had in mind to shoot something like this for a while (a street sign/light pole shot from this angle). It needs a little something else -- maybe better lighting (nearer to dawn or dusk) or something interesting in the signage. Still, a good study in urban scenery.</td>', 'Because you have no comments... I gave this a six. It''s not a true landscape, but neither were a lot of shots in this challenge. It''s urban enough though. I like dramatic angles, and I''ve had in mind to shoot something like this for a while (a street sign/light pole shot from this angle). It needs a little something else -- maybe better lighting (nearer to dawn or dusk) or something interesting in the signage. Still, a good study in urban scenery.', '2008-07-09 08:10:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4813971, 694393, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is good. I like that you made the academic (?) building in the foreground your subject against the backdrop of the city. It''s slightly OOF and the sky is ever-so-slightly noisy, but it''s well composed and interesting.</td>', 'This is good. I like that you made the academic (?) building in the foreground your subject against the backdrop of the city. It''s slightly OOF and the sky is ever-so-slightly noisy, but it''s well composed and interesting.', '2008-07-09 08:12:44.000000', NULL, 0),
