(4815427, 694135, 30982, '<td valign="top">I thought this to be a perfectly wonderful entry!  I''m baffled by the score, to tell you the truth.  You have a lovely balance of foreground greenery, cityscape, sea and sky, all with good rich color.  I''d even say it has a "wow" factor.  The only thing I can think of is not "urban" enough for some?  Looks quite urban to me, though.  Nice work, as always.</td>', 'I thought this to be a perfectly wonderful entry!  I''m baffled by the score, to tell you the truth.  You have a lovely balance of foreground greenery, cityscape, sea and sky, all with good rich color.  I''d even say it has a "wow" factor.  The only thing I can think of is not "urban" enough for some?  Looks quite urban to me, though.  Nice work, as always.', '2008-07-09 17:49:36.000000', NULL, 0),
