(4816661, 692678, 57229, '<td valign="top">You got people points from me. It''s an odd sort of category, ''cityscapes''. It sort of means urban landscape photography, which gives you all the skyline shots, fair enough... But it''s not really a city without people, is it?<br/> <br/>Great shot. Long may they busk.</td>', 'You got people points from me. It''s an odd sort of category, ''cityscapes''. It sort of means urban landscape photography, which gives you all the skyline shots, fair enough... But it''s not really a city without people, is it? Great shot. Long may they busk.', '2008-07-10 06:19:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4817058, 694183, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well. you got ROBBED, Steve :-( I don''t see how anyonw can think this doesn''t have the landscape elements in it, and it''s quintessentially urban as well. Not to mention being a lovely, compelling slice of life image...</td>', 'Well. you got ROBBED, Steve :-( I don''t see how anyonw can think this doesn''t have the landscape elements in it, and it''s quintessentially urban as well. Not to mention being a lovely, compelling slice of life image...', '2008-07-10 12:25:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4817144, 693555, 30861, '<td valign="top">Elegantly competent rendition of sophisticated boredom :-) I''d be happier with more sky and less foreground, the split is too much in the middle and the foreground isn''t adding anything much. Now, if there was a model sailboat on the pond left fore or something :-)<br/> <br/>It''s a nice shot though, really :-)</td>', 'Elegantly competent rendition of sophisticated boredom :-) I''d be happier with more sky and less foreground, the split is too much in the middle and the foreground isn''t adding anything much. Now, if there was a model sailboat on the pond left fore or something :-) It''s a nice shot though, really :-)', '2008-07-10 13:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
