(4907726, 692274, 49804, '<td valign="top">I think this would benefit a lot from a shallower dof so that just the fence is in focus or just the city is in focus, and some work with the composition could help. Typically the "rule of thirds" is helpful to try and follow. Here the horizon is right in the middle of the photo which takes away from the shot. I think getting more sky and less flowers could help. Hope thats helpful.</td>', 'I think this would benefit a lot from a shallower dof so that just the fence is in focus or just the city is in focus, and some work with the composition could help. Typically the "rule of thirds" is helpful to try and follow. Here the horizon is right in the middle of the photo which takes away from the shot. I think getting more sky and less flowers could help. Hope thats helpful.', '2008-08-24 13:47:21.000000', NULL, 0),
